From 2034603e057740078226ee73a2b588b9ffa064f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:02:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: Security Review per-row actions, watch rules and the
 acceptance log

Each row gains Accept, Existence only, Ignore and Ignore folder; rule-changed
rows show grey. The card gains the watch-rules box (save validated by the
CGI) and the newest ten acceptance-log entries. Path globs are escaped before
a rule is written.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
